lambdock (0.13.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: the dock is drivable by keyboard and readable by a
    screen reader, with a reduce-motion setting; the stack fan is rebuilt and
    shows live thumbnails in every view; the launchpad tiles and backdrop are
    configurable; and the preferences window is roomier with exact-value spin
    buttons.

